### create without a key
--- plan
Target ma-self-hosted (managed-agents/self-hosted)

  + Environment/tools
      note: the worker needs the environment's key in the environment variables as SOLARIA_TEST_ENVIRONMENT_KEY; apply creates the environment and then says how to get one

  + Agent/reviewer
      resolvedDigest: sha256:e5264a3555c6

Plan: 2 to create, 0 to update, 0 to replace, 0 to delete or archive.
--- apply requests
POST /v1/environments
  {
    "config": {
      "type": "self_hosted"
    },
    "description": "Solaria target ma-self-hosted, Environment tools",
    "metadata": {
      "solaria_environment": "tools",
      "solaria_target": "ma-self-hosted"
    },
    "name": "ma-self-hosted"
  }
--- error
create Environment/tools: environment ma-self-hosted (env_01) exists, but its worker can't start without the environment's key: generate one in the Claude Console, under Managed Agents > Environments > ma-self-hosted, store it in the environment variables as SOLARIA_TEST_ENVIRONMENT_KEY, and run apply again

### start the worker
